     "description": "No stranger to bringing fans to their feet with highlight-reel stops, Andrei Vasilevskiy delivers again in dramatic fashion. Facing a 2-on-1 Oilers rush in overtime, he turns aside the initial shot, but the danger isn\u2019t over as the puck sits loose in the crease.  With Connor Brown ready to bury it into an open net, Vasilevskiy reacts in an instant\u2014kicking out his pad at the last possible moment to rob him with a sensational save. The game-changing stop sparks Tampa Bay the other way, leading to the rush that results in the overtime winner.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
